Suggests: python3-zeep
Description: DNA fragment analysis tool
 CE-machine-independent tool for fragment analysis data processing.
 Supports baseline correction and denoising, selective channel hiding,
 peak detection and sizing, allele binning using GeneMapper,
 GeneMarker and NCBI OSIRIS panels, stutter alleles filtering, CSV
 export, and CODIS CMF export and import (standard 3.2 and 3.3 plus
 Rapid Import). It also provides a reference-profile database with
 profile comparison and search, forensic STR statistics and allele
 frequency tables, and a SOAP API.
